{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"sChanId":["296"],"sTitle":"「先遣赏金-区域巡防」活动说明","sIntro":"「先遣赏金-区域巡防」活动说明","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动时间】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2026/09/23 04:00（服务器时间）~2026/09/28 03:59（服务器时间）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【参与条件】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e绳网等级≥21级并完成绳网声望晋升任务「绳之道I」，且解锁「区域巡防」后即可参与。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 「先遣赏金-区域巡防」活动期间，绳匠进入「区域巡防」，挑战并通过任意关卡即可获得双倍奖励！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 活动期间，每日可增益2场挑战，增益效果将在每日04:00（服务器时间）重置。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166192/6f8c907de7aae2e6b1eb157b78701694_6805775036137552336.png\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS-1920.png\",\"url\":\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166192/6f8c907de7aae2e6b1eb157b78701694_1851576465282802275.png\"}],\"news-self-path\":\"\"}","dtStartTime":"2026-09-21 12:30:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","sCategoryName":"","sTagName":[],"dtCreateTime":"2026-09-18 18:33:26","iInfoId":166192,"around":{"prevContent":{"sChanId":["295"],"sTitle":"生日快乐维琳娜丨尽享片刻安闲 ","sIntro":"「感谢店长百忙之中能够抽出时间来赴茶会之约~」 ","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「感谢店长百忙之中能够抽出时间来赴茶会之约~」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「我吗？店长不会把我当成什么全年无休的工作狂了吧。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「公务固然重要，但是茶会也是不可或缺的一环。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e「好了，是时候享受这片刻的闲暇时光了~」 \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166193/6783cf6693736a2c23a62a64a21a92f2_1136074232498842514.jpg\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"1200_675.jpg\",\"url\":\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166193/f60eb3da80ecf446aa13fa02570dd7d8_303025222760819827.jpg\"}]}","dtStartTime":"2026-09-22 12:00:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2026-09-18 18:33:49","iInfoId":166193,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""},"nextContent":{"sChanId":["296"],"sTitle":"「惊喜放映企划」活动说明","sIntro":"「惊喜放映企划」活动说明","sUrl":"","sAuthor":"","sContent":"\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动时间】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e2026/09/23 10:00（服务器时间） ~ 2026/10/20 03:59（服务器时间）\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【参与条件】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e绳网等级≥5级，完成主线序章「兔与绳」并解锁「活动」功能后即可参与。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4 style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e【活动说明】\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 「惊喜放映企划」活动期间，累计登录可获得「妄想天使」限定时装自选（可在时装[南宫羽·心动应援中]、时装[爱芮·萌力加载中]、时装[千夏·梦想营业中]任选其一）、活动专属头像[伊埃斯的新头像]、[菲林]等奖励！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e※每件时装绳匠仅能领取一次，不可重复领取；尚未拥有[千夏]、[爱芮]和[南宫羽]的绳匠依然可以领取时装，获得后可在代理人的「穿搭」界面中查看时装。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 绳匠满足累计登录条件后，需在「惊喜放映企划」活动页面领取对应奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 2;\"\u003e• 所有奖励领取后，活动页面将于次日04:00（服务器时间）关闭。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166191/dbd577e176f642f0b6c72d9019d32858_4349373645136080774.jpg\" href=\"\" data-origin-width=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","sExt":"{\"news-banner\":[{\"name\":\"CHS.jpg\",\"url\":\"/archive/files/fastcdn.hoyoverse.com/content-v2/nap/166191/dbd577e176f642f0b6c72d9019d32858_6607487750046539829.jpg\"}],\"news-self-path\":\"\"}","dtStartTime":"2026-09-21 12:15:00","dtEndTime":"2035-01-01 00:00:00","dtCreateTime":"2026-09-18 18:32:58","iInfoId":166191,"sTagName":[],"sCategoryName":"","sSign":""}},"sSign":""}}